{"name":"Waiouru","hex":"#4c4e31","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Waiouru","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A small town in Ruapehu district, Manawatū-Whanganui region, New Zealand."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Waiouru"}],"entries":[{"title":"Waiouru","blocks":[{"text":"Waiouru is a small town in the Ruapehu District, in New Zealand's Manawatū-Whanganui region. It is located on the south-eastern North Island Volcanic Plateau, 130 km (81 mi) north of Palmerston North and 25 kilometres south-east of Mount Ruapehu. The town had a population of 861 in the 2023 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/EF30163%2BOverlander_NearWaiouru_22March2003_JChristianson.jpg/330px-EF30163%2BOverlander_NearWaiouru_22March2003_JChristianson.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waiouru"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/NZ-Waiouru-Museum2.jpg/500px-NZ-Waiouru-Museum2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/NZ-Waiouru-Museum2.jpg/500px-NZ-Waiouru-Museum2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANZ-Waiouru-Museum2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Train_at_Waiouru_Railway_Station%2C_with_Mount_Ruapehu_in_the_background_ATLIB_308244.png/500px-Train_at_Waiouru_Railway_Station%2C_with_Mount_Ruapehu_in_the_background_ATLIB_308244.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Train_at_Waiouru_Railway_Station%2C_with_Mount_Ruapehu_in_the_background_ATLIB_308244.png/1280px-Train_at_Waiouru_Railway_Station%2C_with_Mount_Ruapehu_in_the_background_ATLIB_308244.png?utm